                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Ministry of Health's Drug Advisory Committee has recommended the following inhaled corticosteroid/long-acting beta"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "subscript"
                            }
                          ],
                          "text": "2"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " agonist (ICS/LABA) inhalers for inclusion on the MOH Standard Drug List (SDL) for treating asthma in view of acceptable clinical and cost-effectiveness:"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "hardBreak"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "unorderedList",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "attrs": {},
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Fluticasone furoate/vilanterol (Relvar Ellipta) 100/25 mcg (30 inhalations) and 200/25 mcg (30 inhalations) inhalation powder;"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "attrs": {},
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Budesonide/formoterol (DuoResp Spiromax) 160/4.5 mcg (120 inhalations) and 320/9 mcg (60 inhalations) inhalation powder."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Committee has also recommended the following ICS/LABA inhalers for retention on the MOH SDL, in view of acceptable proposals from the companies:"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "hardBreak"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "unorderedList",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "attrs": {},
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Fluticasone propionate/salmeterol (Seretide Accuhaler) 100/50 mcg (60 inhalations), 250/50 mcg (60 inhalations), 500/50 mcg (60 inhalations) inhalation powder;"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "attrs": {},
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Fluticasone propionate/salmeterol (Seretide Accuhaler) 100/50 mcg (60 inhalations), 250/50 mcg (60 inhalations), 500/50 mcg (60 inhalations) inhalation powder;"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "attrs": {},
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Budesonide/formoterol (Symbicort Turbuhaler) 160/4.5 mcg (120 inhalations) inhalation powder"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "attrs": {},
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Budesonide/formoterol (Symbicort Rapihaler) 80/2.25 mcg (120 inhalations), 160/4.5 mcg (120 inhalations) inhalation aerosol."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Of note, Symbicort Turbuhaler 80/4.5 mcg, 320/9 mcg and Symbicort Rapihaler 80/4.5 mcg will be delisted with effect from 1 August 2023 due to discontinuation by the company."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "content": [
